# Striatum Gemini Extension (v{striatum_version})

Generated by `striatum plugin install --profile gemini`.

## Install

```
gemini extensions install ./.striatum/plugins/gemini
```

This copies the bundle into `~/.gemini/extensions/striatum/`.

User-scope: pass `--scope user` at generation to write directly to
`~/.gemini/extensions/striatum/` instead.

## Layout

- `gemini-extension.json` — Gemini extension manifest
- `GEMINI.md` — context file (auto-loaded by Gemini)
- `skills/striatum-*/SKILL.md` — five skills (byte-shared with
  the Claude Code profile)
- `commands/*.toml` — five slash commands (TOML format)
- `agents/striatum-recover.md` — focused recovery sub-agent
- `.manifest.json` — Striatum-side regeneration manifest
